  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/01/IMG_6452.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El Mercat Municipal de Onda ha despedido la ma&ntilde;ana de este s&aacute;bado su campa&ntilde;a de Navidad con la instalaci&oacute;n de un castillo hinchable en la plaza de Espa&ntilde;a, donde ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as han podido disfrutar a pesar del viento.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/castellinflableplacaespanyamercatonda/img_6451.jpg\" alt=\"img_6451\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/castellinflableplacaespanyamercatonda/img_6452.jpg\" alt=\"img_6452\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/castellinflableplacaespanyamercatonda/img_6453.jpg\" alt=\"img_6453\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/castellinflableplacaespanyamercatonda/img_6454.jpg\" alt=\"img_6454\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
